WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:06.933
Upon arrival in Shalour City, our heroes reunited with Korrina,

2
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:09.900
the Shalour Gym Leader, and her Lucario.

3
00:00:09.966 --> 00:00:12.800
After several attempts to perfect Tierno's rhythmic battle style

4
00:00:12.866 --> 00:00:15.200
in preparation for his Gym battle against Korrina,

5
00:00:15.266 --> 00:00:18.966
Ash was ultimately unable to contain his excitement.

6
00:00:19.033 --> 00:00:23.000
Now, after his decision to challenge the Gym as soon as possible,

7
00:00:23.066 --> 00:00:27.166
our hero's Shalour City Gym battle challenge is underway!

8
00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:31.766
♪ I want to be the very best ♪

9
00:00:31.833 --> 00:00:35.533
♪ Like no one ever was ♪

10
00:00:35.600 --> 00:00:38.133
♪ To catch them is my real test ♪

11
00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:41.233
♪ To train them is my cause ♪

12
00:00:41.300 --> 00:00:44.300
♪ Pokémon! Got to catch them all It's you and me ♪

13
00:00:44.366 --> 00:00:47.500
♪ Pokémon! I know it's my destiny ♪

14
00:00:47.566 --> 00:00:50.933
♪ Pokémon! Yeah, you're my best friend ♪

15
00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:53.666
♪ In a world we must defend ♪

16
00:00:53.733 --> 00:00:55.866
♪ Pokémon! Got to catch them all ♪

17
00:00:55.933 --> 00:00:58.966
♪ Got to catch them all! Pokémon! ♪

18
00:01:13.766 --> 00:01:16.400
- Fro! Fro!
- You wanted to battle too.

19
00:01:16.466 --> 00:01:18.933
- Didn't you, Froakie?
- Froakie!

20
00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:23.000
Froakie, you worked really hard with me on the rhythmic battle style.

21
00:01:23.066 --> 00:01:26.200
I know. Stay right there and cheer me on in rhythm!

22
00:01:26.266 --> 00:01:28.266
- Pika! Pika!
- Kie, Kie!

23
00:01:29.200 --> 00:01:31.766
Now, let's get that battle rhythm going!

24
00:01:31.833 --> 00:01:35.400
- Battle rhythm! A mystery.
- Nothing mysterious about it.

25
00:01:35.466 --> 00:01:37.766
You saw it!

26
00:01:37.833 --> 00:01:40.433
- That's why it's a mystery.
- Look out.

27
00:01:40.500 --> 00:01:43.533
I'm giving it all I've got! And soon, I'll win!

28
00:01:43.600 --> 00:01:46.300
All right, Mr. Confidence, bring it!

29
00:01:47.500 --> 00:01:51.800
- Wow! Looks like a real rivalry!
- Na-na-na!

30
00:01:53.800 --> 00:01:55.600
Mienfoo, let's do it!

31
00:01:58.166 --> 00:01:59.800
Wow, who's that?

32
00:01:59.866 --> 00:02:02.466
Mienfoo, the Martial Arts Pokémon.

33
00:02:02.533 --> 00:02:04.833
Mienfoo's battle moves become quicker and more precise

34
00:02:04.900 --> 00:02:06.500
with increased concentration.

35
00:02:06.566 --> 00:02:09.733
- Let's have a great battle, Mienfoo!
- Mienfoo!

36
00:02:09.800 --> 00:02:12.233
- Ash is having so much fun!
- That's true.

37
00:02:12.300 --> 00:02:15.500
But I wonder how useful that rhythmic battle style will be.

38
00:02:15.566 --> 00:02:17.733
You're worried that Ash can't dance, right?

39
00:02:17.800 --> 00:02:19.533
As soon as Ash saw Korrina,

40
00:02:19.600 --> 00:02:22.533
he stopped trying to perfect his rhythmic battle style.

41
00:02:22.600 --> 00:02:26.466
From that point on, you could say Korrina got Ash completely off his game.

42
00:02:26.533 --> 00:02:28.833
- Huh?
- Stop!

43
00:02:28.900 --> 00:02:31.200
Hey, whose side are you on anyway?

44
00:02:31.266 --> 00:02:33.966
Bonnie, the real action in a Gym battle begins

45
00:02:34.033 --> 00:02:37.333
from the very moment a Trainer challenges a Gym.

46
00:02:37.400 --> 00:02:40.200
Hawlucha, I choose you!

47
00:02:41.666 --> 00:02:43.400
Haw!

48
00:02:43.466 --> 00:02:45.233
I knew he'd go with Hawlucha!

49
00:02:45.300 --> 00:02:48.600
- Good luck to both of you!
- Kie, Froakie!

50
00:02:48.666 --> 00:02:50.600
Gym battle, begin!

51
00:02:50.666 --> 00:02:54.166
All right, then, Ash, show me what you've got!

52
00:02:54.233 --> 00:02:56.066
Don't disappoint us, Korrina!

53
00:03:00.566 --> 00:03:03.466
Let's get our Shalour Gym strategy rolling!

54
00:03:03.533 --> 00:03:07.700
-One, two, one, two, one, two!

55
00:03:07.766 --> 00:03:10.233
- Hawlucha's doing it!
- That's great!

56
00:03:10.300 --> 00:03:12.833
But doesn't Ash need to dance, too?

57
00:03:12.900 --> 00:03:16.200
Pikachu, Pikachu, Pipi! Kachu!

58
00:03:16.266 --> 00:03:19.166
Would you look at that? Pikachu's got Hawlucha's rhythm!

59
00:03:19.233 --> 00:03:22.600
- Dedenne!
- That's awesome, Hawlucha! Bravo!

60
00:03:22.666 --> 00:03:25.466
Yup. There you go with that mysterious rhythm.

61
00:03:25.533 --> 00:03:28.766
But now what are you going to do with it? High Jump Kick!

62
00:03:28.833 --> 00:03:31.833
- Use your rhythm to dodge it!
- Haw!

63
00:03:36.366 --> 00:03:39.166
- Hawlucha!
- Let's keep up the pressure.

64
00:03:39.233 --> 00:03:42.900
- Use Drain Punch, let's go!
- Mien!

65
00:03:42.966 --> 00:03:45.333
Use your rhythm to block!

66
00:03:45.400 --> 00:03:48.100
Mienfoo!

67
00:03:53.666 --> 00:03:56.100
- Cha!
- Hang in there and use Karate Chop!

68
00:03:56.166 --> 00:03:57.800
- Deflect it with a kick!
- Mien!

69
00:04:01.200 --> 00:04:03.733
Mienfoo's got such precise movements!

70
00:04:03.800 --> 00:04:06.100
Oh! I can't watch!

71
00:04:06.166 --> 00:04:08.633
It doesn't look like Hawlucha can do anything.

72
00:04:08.700 --> 00:04:11.500
What's going on? Tierno's Squirtle was just fine.

73
00:04:11.566 --> 00:04:13.966
It had no problem moving around.

74
00:04:16.133 --> 00:04:18.866
Force Palm!

75
00:04:20.600 --> 00:04:23.733
Pikachu, Pikachu, Pikachu!

76
00:04:23.800 --> 00:04:25.733
Hawlucha!

77
00:04:25.800 --> 00:04:29.500
So come on and surprise us some more, Ash. We're ready!

78
00:04:29.566 --> 00:04:31.866
- Can you still battle?
- Cha.

79
00:04:31.933 --> 00:04:33.733
Then use Flying Press!

80
00:04:33.800 --> 00:04:37.466
- Mienfoo, use Swift!
- Mien! Foo!

81
00:04:37.533 --> 00:04:40.566
Not a Fighting-type move? Use Rhythm!

82
00:04:43.633 --> 00:04:45.533
Hawlucha, no!

83
00:04:46.666 --> 00:04:50.333
Come on, Ash! Don't disappoint us! Let's wrap it up.

84
00:04:50.400 --> 00:04:52.333
- Okay, Mienfoo?
- Mienfoo!

85
00:04:54.666 --> 00:04:58.600
Pikachu! Pikachu! Pikachu! Pikachu!

86
00:04:58.666 --> 00:05:01.666
How am I going to win this?

87
00:05:01.733 --> 00:05:06.100
Come on, Ash, you can do it! You've got to win that badge! Come on!

88
00:05:07.100 --> 00:05:09.800
No, no, Ash. It goes like this!

89
00:05:09.866 --> 00:05:12.400
- Like this?
- No, like this!

90
00:05:12.466 --> 00:05:14.100
This?

91
00:05:14.166 --> 00:05:17.300
Sorry. You've got no sense of rhythm at all.

92
00:05:17.366 --> 00:05:19.100
-Aw!

93
00:05:19.166 --> 00:05:22.600
- I know this can't be easy for you.
- You can say that again.

94
00:05:22.666 --> 00:05:26.933
You know, I guess you've just got your own unique sense of rhythm.

95
00:05:27.000 --> 00:05:29.100
Really? My own?

96
00:05:30.866 --> 00:05:36.233
Serena was right. I'm not going to be able to win this thing by copying Tierno!

97
00:05:36.300 --> 00:05:38.433
- Pika?
- Thanks, Pikachu.

98
00:05:38.500 --> 00:05:41.166
You don't have to dance anymore.

99
00:05:41.233 --> 00:05:45.033
That rhythmic battle style worked because Tierno was doing it.

100
00:05:45.100 --> 00:05:48.033
But we've got our own unique rhythm.

101
00:05:48.100 --> 00:05:51.266
Dancing may be Tierno's style, but it's not mine!

102
00:05:51.333 --> 00:05:55.500
Okay, let's do this! We'll show them our own unique battling style!

103
00:05:55.566 --> 00:05:58.033
Haw? Lucha!

104
00:05:58.100 --> 00:06:01.600
You honestly think you can just change your strategy mid-battle?

105
00:06:01.666 --> 00:06:04.500
Yeah! Hawlucha knows what to do for sure!

106
00:06:04.566 --> 00:06:08.066
- Haw-Haw!
- I just don't get it.

107
00:06:08.133 --> 00:06:12.733
You're not going to win like that! Let's wrap this up with High Jump Kick!

108
00:06:14.666 --> 00:06:16.833
- Not yet. Draw it in.
- Haw!

109
00:06:16.900 --> 00:06:18.500
- Mien!
- Go for it!

110
00:06:18.566 --> 00:06:20.600
-Foo!

111
00:06:23.233 --> 00:06:25.233
- Ha!

112
00:06:25.300 --> 00:06:26.500
Ming!

113
00:06:26.566 --> 00:06:29.466
I guess Ash decided to drop the rhythmic battle style.

114
00:06:29.533 --> 00:06:31.166
Wow, that was a perfect dodge!

115
00:06:31.233 --> 00:06:34.733
And when a High Jump Kick misses, the attacker ends up getting hurt!

116
00:06:34.800 --> 00:06:36.666
Now, Karate Chop, let's go!

117
00:06:36.733 --> 00:06:40.733
Haw! Lu! Cha!

118
00:06:40.800 --> 00:06:42.700
Nope! Use Force Palm!

119
00:06:42.766 --> 00:06:45.000
- Use Flying Press!
- Haw!

120
00:06:47.200 --> 00:06:49.766
Lu!

121
00:06:49.833 --> 00:06:51.466
Cha!

122
00:06:52.866 --> 00:06:55.333
Mienfoo!

123
00:06:58.500 --> 00:07:01.866
Mienfoo is unable to battle! Hawlucha is the winner!

124
00:07:01.933 --> 00:07:04.400
- Yes!
- Hawcha!

125
00:07:04.466 --> 00:07:07.666
-Pikachu!

126
00:07:07.733 --> 00:07:10.433
-All right!

127
00:07:10.500 --> 00:07:14.266
As soon as Ash started using his own style, everything turned around!

128
00:07:14.333 --> 00:07:16.666
Ash, I know you can do this!

129
00:07:16.733 --> 00:07:18.766
There you go, 1-0!

130
00:07:18.833 --> 00:07:21.766
All right, Ash. You might be ahead for now.

131
00:07:21.833 --> 00:07:24.600
But the next battle won't be so easy!

132
00:07:27.666 --> 00:07:31.400
- The twerps are stoked!
- So stoked, they won't notice a thing.

133
00:07:31.466 --> 00:07:34.966
And clueless twerps are just perfect for Pokémon-picking time.

134
00:07:35.033 --> 00:07:37.100
Wobbuf--

135
00:07:37.166 --> 00:07:40.366
Here we go, Ash. Machoke! My second Pokémon!

136
00:07:43.100 --> 00:07:44.466
Machoke!

137
00:07:44.533 --> 00:07:46.800
Hawlucha, return!

138
00:07:47.733 --> 00:07:49.433
Rest up for now.

139
00:07:49.500 --> 00:07:52.033
Next up is Fletchinder. I choose you!

140
00:07:53.666 --> 00:07:55.733
- Fletch!
- Another Flying type.

141
00:07:55.800 --> 00:07:57.866
Fletchinder, you'll be great!

142
00:07:57.933 --> 00:08:01.133
- You can do it, Ash!

143
00:08:01.200 --> 00:08:03.866
- All right, Fletchinder! Flame Charge!
- Pika!

144
00:08:03.933 --> 00:08:05.266
Fletchinder!

145
00:08:05.333 --> 00:08:09.400
Machoke! Run, then jump!

146
00:08:12.266 --> 00:08:13.833
- Fletch!
- Brick Break, let's go!

147
00:08:18.866 --> 00:08:20.366
That's some power!

148
00:08:20.433 --> 00:08:22.300
Hey, get up, Fletchinder, now!

149
00:08:22.366 --> 00:08:24.233
Fletch!

150
00:08:25.300 --> 00:08:28.600
Low Sweep, go!

151
00:08:28.666 --> 00:08:30.933
-Pika!

152
00:08:31.000 --> 00:08:34.200
Way to hang in there! Now use Steel Wing!

153
00:08:34.266 --> 00:08:37.666
- Fletch! Fletchinder!
- Here is comes, Machoke!

154
00:08:40.900 --> 00:08:43.666
- Machoke stopped him!
- All right, Machoke, throw it!

155
00:08:43.733 --> 00:08:45.533
Razor Wind!

156
00:08:45.600 --> 00:08:48.800
- Fletchinder!
- Go!

157
00:08:50.666 --> 00:08:53.566
-Focus Blast!

158
00:08:53.633 --> 00:08:56.833
-Flame Charge, let's go!

159
00:08:58.300 --> 00:09:04.833
Fletch!

160
00:09:04.900 --> 00:09:08.566
-Fletch! Fletchinder!

161
00:09:10.700 --> 00:09:14.566
Machoke is unable to battle! Fletchinder's the winner!

162
00:09:14.633 --> 00:09:16.800
- Fletch, Fletch!
- And that's 2-0.

163
00:09:16.866 --> 00:09:18.933
- All right!
- Hooray!

164
00:09:19.000 --> 00:09:20.766
Dedenne!

165
00:09:20.833 --> 00:09:24.800
- You know what that means?
- Oh yeah. Here we go.

166
00:09:27.566 --> 00:09:29.000
Machoke, take a rest.

167
00:09:29.066 --> 00:09:33.000
You looked totally amazing out there. Thanks.

168
00:09:33.066 --> 00:09:36.166
Now, my final Pokémon, the star of my team!

169
00:09:40.333 --> 00:09:42.766
We've been waiting for you, Lucario.

170
00:09:42.833 --> 00:09:44.300
Pika! Pika!

171
00:09:44.366 --> 00:09:47.500
Challenger! Will you switch out your Pokémon?

172
00:09:47.566 --> 00:09:49.866
Nope. I'm going to stick with Fletchinder!

173
00:09:49.933 --> 00:09:52.533
- Chinder!
- The time has come.

174
00:09:52.600 --> 00:09:55.533
I wonder how Ash will take on Lucario.

175
00:09:55.600 --> 00:09:57.533
Oh!

176
00:09:59.000 --> 00:10:01.600
Lucario, go!

177
00:10:01.666 --> 00:10:05.600
Unlock the power within!

178
00:10:06.866 --> 00:10:09.066
Mega Evolve!

179
00:10:33.000 --> 00:10:35.500
Who's that Pokémon?

180
00:10:40.000 --> 00:10:42.300
It's Mienfoo!

181
00:10:48.466 --> 00:10:50.833
There it is. It Mega Evolved!

182
00:10:50.900 --> 00:10:53.833
Pika! Pika! Pika! Pika!

183
00:10:55.166 --> 00:10:57.100
Let's do this. Flame Charge!

184
00:10:57.166 --> 00:10:59.233
- Pika!
- Fletch!

185
00:10:59.300 --> 00:11:01.633
Lucario, Metal Sound!

186
00:11:04.833 --> 00:11:08.966
Fight through it. Go on!

187
00:11:09.033 --> 00:11:11.233
Fletchinder!

188
00:11:14.300 --> 00:11:16.033
Super-effective!

189
00:11:16.100 --> 00:11:19.233
The appearance of Mega Lucario has them all jazzed!

190
00:11:19.300 --> 00:11:21.400
Soon we'll be leaving them razzed!

191
00:11:21.466 --> 00:11:22.833
Wobb--

192
00:11:22.900 --> 00:11:27.833
That Fire-type move really packed a punch, but try this on for size!

193
00:11:27.900 --> 00:11:30.300
Aura Sphere!

194
00:11:33.766 --> 00:11:36.166
Fletchinder! Use Steel Wing to block!

195
00:11:36.233 --> 00:11:39.566
Fletchinder!

196
00:11:39.633 --> 00:11:41.700
- Oh!
- Power-Up Punch!

197
00:11:46.166 --> 00:11:50.400
Fletchinder is unable to battle! Lucario's the winner!

198
00:11:51.300 --> 00:11:54.433
You were great, Fletchinder. Thanks a lot.

199
00:11:54.500 --> 00:11:55.966
Now it's 2-1, Korrina!

200
00:11:56.033 --> 00:11:58.533
It's been a while since you've seen Lucario.

201
00:11:58.600 --> 00:12:01.500
The two of us have been training really hard

202
00:12:01.566 --> 00:12:06.100
to make sure our hearts are bonded as one, ever since we worked with Mabel.

203
00:12:06.166 --> 00:12:08.833
Now, who will you be using next?

204
00:12:08.900 --> 00:12:12.266
Hawlucha, I choose you!

205
00:12:13.900 --> 00:12:16.300
- Cha!
- Karate Chop, let's go!

206
00:12:16.366 --> 00:12:20.300
- Hawlucha, good luck!
- You can do it!

207
00:12:20.366 --> 00:12:22.833
This battle has reached its peak!

208
00:12:22.900 --> 00:12:24.566
- Pikachu's ours!
- Kie?

209
00:12:24.633 --> 00:12:27.600
Froakie!

210
00:12:28.500 --> 00:12:31.800
- Oh, no! Not you guys again!
- Team Rocket!

211
00:12:31.866 --> 00:12:34.433
Why do you even have to be here?

212
00:12:34.500 --> 00:12:37.366
Spoken like a silly twerp. We're hard at work.

213
00:12:37.433 --> 00:12:40.566
- Right. So stay out of our way.
- Kie! Kie! Fro! Fro!

214
00:12:40.633 --> 00:12:43.300
Froakie says we're the ones in the way of their work.

215
00:12:43.366 --> 00:12:45.966
There's no doubt you're planning to do something shameful!

216
00:12:46.033 --> 00:12:48.166
You're not interfering with Ash's battle!

217
00:12:48.233 --> 00:12:53.466
The shame is wasting our time with twerpy idle threats! Cool your twerpish jets!

218
00:12:53.533 --> 00:12:56.633
Want to fight? Then let's!

219
00:12:56.700 --> 00:12:59.366
- Pumpkaboo!
- Ink!

220
00:12:59.433 --> 00:13:01.800
Pumpkaboo, dear, use Shadow Ball!

221
00:13:01.866 --> 00:13:03.633
Okay, Inkay, use Psybeam!

222
00:13:05.566 --> 00:13:08.133
Froakie!

223
00:13:08.200 --> 00:13:10.600
- Oh!
- Froakie, that was great!

224
00:13:10.666 --> 00:13:12.833
Chespin, I need your help!

225
00:13:12.900 --> 00:13:14.466
Fennekin, you too!

226
00:13:15.966 --> 00:13:17.600
- Ches!
- Fenn!

227
00:13:17.666 --> 00:13:20.266
- Pin Missile, go!
- Use Flamethrower!

228
00:13:20.333 --> 00:13:22.166
Chespin!

229
00:13:22.233 --> 00:13:25.033
Fennekin!

230
00:13:26.600 --> 00:13:30.000
We're blasting off again!

231
00:13:30.066 --> 00:13:32.800
Wobbuffet!

232
00:13:34.833 --> 00:13:37.366
- Huh?

233
00:13:37.433 --> 00:13:41.366
- Did something just happen?
- No.

234
00:13:41.433 --> 00:13:42.933
Nothing at all!

235
00:13:43.000 --> 00:13:45.233
Go get 'em, Hawlucha!

236
00:13:45.300 --> 00:13:48.066
Froakie!

237
00:13:50.200 --> 00:13:53.900
- Flying Press, go!
- Haw!

238
00:13:53.966 --> 00:13:57.133
Lucario, Bone Rush!

239
00:14:02.000 --> 00:14:03.633
- Cha.
- Keep on going.

240
00:14:03.700 --> 00:14:06.033
Aura Sphere!

241
00:14:06.100 --> 00:14:10.566
- Hawlucha!

242
00:14:15.033 --> 00:14:19.133
Hawlucha is unable to battle! Lucario's the winner!

243
00:14:19.200 --> 00:14:21.466
All right!

244
00:14:21.533 --> 00:14:25.466
Thanks a lot, Hawlucha. Now, take a good rest!

245
00:14:26.466 --> 00:14:30.566
It wasn't just Korrina and Lucario who got stronger from special training.

246
00:14:30.633 --> 00:14:32.300
- We did, too.
- Pikachu.

247
00:14:32.366 --> 00:14:35.300
Pikachu, it's all up to you now.

248
00:14:35.366 --> 00:14:36.933
Pika! Pika!

249
00:14:37.000 --> 00:14:40.900
All right, let's show those two everything we've learned up to this point!

250
00:14:40.966 --> 00:14:45.633
We'll do it for Hawlucha and Fletchinder. Okay, Pikachu, I choose you!

251
00:14:45.700 --> 00:14:47.433
Pikachu! Pikachu!

252
00:14:47.500 --> 00:14:50.433
Pikachu, huh? Finally!

253
00:14:50.500 --> 00:14:53.933
No matter who the opponent is, whenever they move, they leave an opening!

254
00:14:54.000 --> 00:14:58.400
Now, keep a sharp eye on all of Mega Lucario's movements.

255
00:14:58.466 --> 00:15:01.733
We know that Pikachu's never defeated Lucario before.

256
00:15:01.800 --> 00:15:05.266
How will Pikachu handle an even more powerful Mega Lucario?

257
00:15:10.933 --> 00:15:13.033
Why isn't anybody moving?

258
00:15:13.100 --> 00:15:17.500
Both Pikachu and Lucario know that they can't afford to lose this round.

259
00:15:17.566 --> 00:15:19.366
They're trying to be extra careful.

260
00:15:19.433 --> 00:15:21.966
This is going to be a true battle of wills.

261
00:15:22.033 --> 00:15:25.333
I've never seen anything like this before.

262
00:15:25.400 --> 00:15:28.000
- And I've never been so nervous!
- Na-na!

263
00:15:28.800 --> 00:15:31.900
-All right, Pikachu, use Quick Attack!

264
00:15:31.966 --> 00:15:34.400
Pikachu! Pik, Pik, Pik!

265
00:15:34.466 --> 00:15:38.200
- Ash is making his move!
- What about Mega Lucario?

266
00:15:38.266 --> 00:15:40.266
- Pik, Pik, Pik.
- Draw Pikachu in.

267
00:15:40.333 --> 00:15:43.833
- All right, Electro Ball, let's go!
- Pika, Pika, Pika...

268
00:15:43.900 --> 00:15:46.366
Use Bone Rush!

269
00:15:46.433 --> 00:15:50.400
Pika! Pika! Pika! Pikachu!

270
00:15:50.466 --> 00:15:52.766
Hit it back!

271
00:15:54.133 --> 00:15:56.600
- Pika?
- Now use Iron Tail!

272
00:15:56.666 --> 00:15:59.166
- Pika!
- Block it!

273
00:15:59.233 --> 00:16:00.666
Pika!

274
00:16:00.733 --> 00:16:02.500
Now kick up!

275
00:16:02.566 --> 00:16:05.266
- Pika!
- Pikachu! Thunderbolt, let's go!

276
00:16:05.333 --> 00:16:10.133
Pikachu!

277
00:16:10.200 --> 00:16:14.700
- A Thunderbolt after getting hit?
- That's our unique battle style.

278
00:16:14.766 --> 00:16:18.333
Aura Sphere!

279
00:16:18.400 --> 00:16:20.866
-Pika? Pika!

280
00:16:20.933 --> 00:16:22.733
Pi! Pi!

281
00:16:22.800 --> 00:16:25.266
No, Pikachu!

282
00:16:28.933 --> 00:16:32.300
- Pikachu, can you get up?
- Pika. Pika.

283
00:16:32.366 --> 00:16:35.366
Pika! Pika!

284
00:16:35.433 --> 00:16:38.600
Looking good, Ash and Pikachu.

285
00:16:38.666 --> 00:16:41.100
That's 'cause I'm going to win that badge!

286
00:16:41.166 --> 00:16:43.400
Lucario, Metal Sound!

287
00:16:43.466 --> 00:16:44.933
Pika!

288
00:16:45.000 --> 00:16:47.700
Pikachu, use Thunderbolt and wipe out that Metal Sound!

289
00:16:47.766 --> 00:16:52.100
Pika! Pikachu!

290
00:16:54.000 --> 00:16:57.000
Some power play! Aura Sphere!

291
00:16:57.066 --> 00:17:00.266
If Pikachu gets hit after that Metal Sound...

292
00:17:02.633 --> 00:17:06.000
Pikachu, use Iron Tail and knock down that Aura Sphere!

293
00:17:06.066 --> 00:17:08.466
Pikachu! A-pik!

294
00:17:08.533 --> 00:17:10.333
-Look at that!

295
00:17:10.400 --> 00:17:13.433
- What was it?
- Remember from the Cyllage Gym?

296
00:17:13.500 --> 00:17:15.500
Draco Meteor climb!

297
00:17:16.599 --> 00:17:18.900
How is that even possible?

298
00:17:18.966 --> 00:17:21.900
Jump, Lucario! Use Bone Rush!

299
00:17:21.966 --> 00:17:23.900
Iron Tail, let's go!

300
00:17:23.966 --> 00:17:28.133
-Pikachu!

301
00:17:33.900 --> 00:17:37.733
Pika...

302
00:17:37.800 --> 00:17:40.400
- They're both standing!
- That's incredible.

303
00:17:40.466 --> 00:17:43.933
Lucario took the hit from Iron Tail before it reached full speed

304
00:17:44.000 --> 00:17:46.466
and doing that kept the damage it took to a minimum!

305
00:17:46.533 --> 00:17:48.566
Ash and Pikachu, you're amazing!

306
00:17:48.633 --> 00:17:51.700
Using our move like a springboard to make a super high jump.

307
00:17:51.766 --> 00:17:54.466
I thought that would be enough to wrap this up!

308
00:17:54.533 --> 00:17:58.700
- You're a tough one, Korrina!
- But it is almost time to wrap this up.

309
00:17:58.766 --> 00:18:01.000
Use Power-Up Punch!

310
00:18:01.066 --> 00:18:03.766
- Go on, Pikachu, Iron Tail!
- Pika!

311
00:18:03.833 --> 00:18:05.533
-Chu!

312
00:18:07.800 --> 00:18:11.033
- Electro Ball!
- Pika! Pika! Pika!

313
00:18:11.100 --> 00:18:14.100
-Aura Sphere. Go!

314
00:18:14.166 --> 00:18:16.266
-Chupi!

315
00:18:16.333 --> 00:18:18.700
Finish this with Thunderbolt!

316
00:18:18.766 --> 00:18:23.600
Pikachu!

317
00:18:34.600 --> 00:18:39.600
Hm. Lucario is unable to battle. Pikachu wins!

318
00:18:39.666 --> 00:18:43.333
Which means the match goes to Ash, the challenger!

319
00:18:43.400 --> 00:18:48.400
- Huh? Yes! Pikachu!
- Pika!

320
00:18:48.466 --> 00:18:51.100
You were awesome, buddy.

321
00:18:51.166 --> 00:18:54.266
Congratulations, Ash and Pikachu! You did it!

322
00:18:54.333 --> 00:18:57.200
- That was the most exciting battle!
- Dedenne!

323
00:18:57.266 --> 00:19:00.233
And once again, you managed to surprise me!

324
00:19:00.300 --> 00:19:03.700
- Well, you can thank Pikachu for that.
- Pikachu.

325
00:19:03.766 --> 00:19:07.000
You battled well, Lucario.

326
00:19:07.066 --> 00:19:08.700
- Korrina.
- Huh?

327
00:19:08.766 --> 00:19:10.933
That was a fine battle.

328
00:19:11.000 --> 00:19:14.366
Ash deserves all the credit for that.

329
00:19:14.433 --> 00:19:17.133
Pikachu and all his other Pokémon are awesome!

330
00:19:17.200 --> 00:19:20.933
You and I still have a lot of work to do.

331
00:19:21.000 --> 00:19:24.433
Don't forget, as Gym Leader, you still have a duty to perform.

332
00:19:24.500 --> 00:19:25.933
Right!

333
00:19:27.066 --> 00:19:28.633
Ash?

334
00:19:30.066 --> 00:19:32.966
This proves your victory at the Shalour Gym.

335
00:19:33.033 --> 00:19:35.000
The Rumble Badge. Congrats!

336
00:19:35.066 --> 00:19:37.500
Thanks a lot, Korrina!

337
00:19:37.566 --> 00:19:41.333
All right! I just won the Rumble Badge!

338
00:19:41.400 --> 00:19:43.000
Pik! Pikachu!

339
00:19:49.966 --> 00:19:53.466
And now it's on to badge number four!

340
00:19:53.533 --> 00:19:56.900
- So where do you plan on going next?
- Uh, not sure.

341
00:19:56.966 --> 00:19:59.966
Coumarine City is the closest city from here.

342
00:20:00.033 --> 00:20:03.533
Wow! Coumarine City's got a monorail!

343
00:20:03.600 --> 00:20:05.200
Yay! I want a ride!

344
00:20:05.266 --> 00:20:08.400
The Gym Leader there is quite a thorny opponent.

345
00:20:08.466 --> 00:20:11.733
Yeah, but if anybody can handle it, that'll be Ash!

346
00:20:12.900 --> 00:20:16.033
Then it's off to Coumarine City! What do you say, buddy?

347
00:20:16.100 --> 00:20:18.566
- Pika, Pika.
- Ash?

348
00:20:18.633 --> 00:20:21.100
I promise I'm going to make the Shalour Gym

349
00:20:21.166 --> 00:20:25.433
even more passionate than it is now. You make sure you come back soon!

350
00:20:25.500 --> 00:20:28.933
Yeah. I will!

351
00:20:30.433 --> 00:20:33.333
And so, Ash's Shalour City Gym battle challenge

352
00:20:33.400 --> 00:20:35.633
has come to a victorious end!

353
00:20:35.700 --> 00:20:39.466
Ash has his third Kalos Gym badge, the Rumble Badge!

354
00:20:39.533 --> 00:20:42.400
Now, with their sights set on Coumarine City,

355
00:20:42.466 --> 00:20:45.466
our heroes' journey continues!
